        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "J. Employees requesting sick leave under this Article must notify the designated representative of the Appointing Authority at least one (1) hour before the start of his/her work shift on each day of absence. In single shift agencies, employees requesting sick leave under this Article must notify the designated representative not later than fifteen (15) minutes after the start of work on each day of absence. Repeated violations of these procedures may result in denial of sick leave. Such notice must include the general nature of the disability and the estimated period of time for which the employee will be absent. Where circumstances warrant, the Appointing Authority or designee shall reasonably excuse the employee from such daily notification.",
            "block_bbox": [
                136,
                568,
                1083,
                855
            ],
            "block_id": 5,
            "block_order": 6,
            "group_id": 5,
            "block_polygon_points": [
